    "detailed_description": "Elephant Games, the studio that brought you the groundbreaking Strange Investigations: Two for Solitaire presents the anticipated sequel, Strange Investigations: Secrets Can be Deadly!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRenowned investigator Dana and her partner Malcolm barely have a chance to relax after their last adventure when a new and mystifying case is thrust upon them! What starts with an unprovoked attack at Dana's friend's apartment turns out to be a legendary story of betrayal, murder, and revenge. Join Dana as she struggles to find the truth about terrible events of the past and present in this mind-bending Hidden-Object Puzzle game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won't find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game, meaning a specific genre of story-driven, point &amp; click adventures. Throughout the game, players are tasked to find a list of objects hidden within a particular scene, and to occasionally complete various mini-games/puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector's Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\tExclusive wallpapers and music to enjoy!<br />\r\n\u2022\tNever get lost with the official strategy guide!<br />\r\n\u2022\tSolve the mystery of the stolen museum artifacts in the bonus game!<br />\r\n\u2022\tMaster and replay your favorite hidden-object scenes to earn achievements!<br />\r\n\u2022\tTons of collectibles and puzzle pieces to find!",
    "about_the_game": "Elephant Games, the studio that brought you the groundbreaking Strange Investigations: Two for Solitaire presents the anticipated sequel, Strange Investigations: Secrets Can be Deadly!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRenowned investigator Dana and her partner Malcolm barely have a chance to relax after their last adventure when a new and mystifying case is thrust upon them! What starts with an unprovoked attack at Dana's friend's apartment turns out to be a legendary story of betrayal, murder, and revenge. Join Dana as she struggles to find the truth about terrible events of the past and present in this mind-bending Hidden-Object Puzzle game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won't find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game, meaning a specific genre of story-driven, point &amp; click adventures. Throughout the game, players are tasked to find a list of objects hidden within a particular scene, and to occasionally complete various mini-games/puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector's Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\tExclusive wallpapers and music to enjoy!<br />\r\n\u2022\tNever get lost with the official strategy guide!<br />\r\n\u2022\tSolve the mystery of the stolen museum artifacts in the bonus game!<br />\r\n\u2022\tMaster and replay your favorite hidden-object scenes to earn achievements!<br />\r\n\u2022\tTons of collectibles and puzzle pieces to find!",
